LC 202 — Happy Number
Pattern:Hashing

Logic:
Keep calculating sum of squares of digits.
If 1 → happy ✅
If a number repeats → false ❌

ALGO:
Store seen numbers
Calculate sum of digit squares
If sum = 1 → true
If sum already seen → false

CODE:
class Solution {
public:
    bool isHappy(int n) {
        unordered_set<int> seen;

        while (n != 1) {
            if (seen.count(n))
                return false;

            seen.insert(n);
            int sum = 0;

            while (n) {
                int d = n % 10;
                sum += d * d;
                n /= 10;
            }

            n = sum;
        }

        return true;
    }
};


EX:
n = 19

19 → 1² + 9² = 82
82 → 8² + 2² = 68
68 → 6² + 8² = 100
100 → 1² + 0² + 0² = 1

Answer = true ✅
